    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/0dd7d3d00b1c0cde61bae0b90a90fd63.avif?t=1747074798\" data-has-big /></span></p></p><br><h1>Developer Notes</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The game is playable offline.</i></strong> <br><br>On your first run, your system may request a connection permission (it will be labelled as <strong>Portal Fantasy</strong> or, in some cases, <strong>js.node</strong>). This connection is used for current features that require online verification with our servers, such as redeeming referral codes and painting Porbles, as well as for future features like PvP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to reject this connection, and the game will still run, though without access to the features mentioned above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note: the first run after installing the game or after a major update may take slightly longer than usual.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/0f62be979fa956ffe7250f1490ea8006.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/0f62be979fa956ffe7250f1490ea8006.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Capture, Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an epic adventure collecting Porbles to aid you in turn-based battles in this pixel-art  RPG. Fuse your Porbles to enhance, customize, and evolve them to their higher Majesty levels!\u00a0  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect &amp; Fuse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique creatures, Porbles, and gather ingredients to fuse and enhance your team. Discover hundreds of combinations, which can augment your creatures, teach them new skills and even change their appearances.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/974356888e9187c4a83ec7cd3906b41f.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/974356888e9187c4a83ec7cd3906b41f.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/974356888e9187c4a83ec7cd3906b41f.mp4?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based Strategic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic battles with unique passives that trigger based on your team composition. Manage your creatures\u2019 momentum as you unleash their skills to victory. Build a superior squad and enhance your team's synergy and strength with each Porble's unique passive that works together in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/907c70312425e1a15b6f4b0dc96d67f3.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/907c70312425e1a15b6f4b0dc96d67f3.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/907c70312425e1a15b6f4b0dc96d67f3.mp4?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Beautiful Kingdom </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through beautiful pixelated worlds, navigating perils, solving quests, and meeting with countless quirky characters. A captivating story, tons of side content and quests, and a charming soundtrack await you on your adventures.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/c815c2fba37e51b767349693ac62397c.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/c815c2fba37e51b767349693ac62397c.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/c815c2fba37e51b767349693ac62397c.mp4?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Perilous Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your mettle by tackling traps, puzzles and obstacles. The Wilderness is a dangerous place, as you jump and maneuver across moving platforms, voids, spikes, saws, turrets, teleporters and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/096454fabf29fbf69c4eb0032df5aa83.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/096454fabf29fbf69c4eb0032df5aa83.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/096454fabf29fbf69c4eb0032df5aa83.mp4?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize your character\u2019s appearance and fit them with an ever-expanding wardrobe of cute, quirky and fun outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/55a3051d75db6e0402bd97dff9c527cc.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/55a3051d75db6e0402bd97dff9c527cc.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/55a3051d75db6e0402bd97dff9c527cc.mp4?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been 1000 years since the War of the Goddesses - Ravenna is dead, and the Pyli Kingdom has become prosperous once again. Or so it seems. As a novice at the prestigious Porble Academy, life takes an unexpected twist when you arrive late in Valeria, the capital. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assigned trivial tasks by an unassuming assistant, little do you know that this journey will take you into something more sinister. Mysterious organizations, corrupted Porbles, and an ancient adversary await. Across Pyli Kingdom's diverse realms, you'll uncover a darker history than legends tell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step peels away deeper mysteries, each revelation inches you closer to the truth. The burning question: will you survive the lurking secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/0f62be979fa956ffe7250f1490ea8006.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/0f62be979fa956ffe7250f1490ea8006.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Capture, Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an epic adventure collecting Porbles to aid you in turn-based battles in this pixel-art  RPG. Fuse your Porbles to enhance, customize, and evolve them to their higher Majesty levels!\u00a0  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect &amp; Fuse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique creatures, Porbles, and gather ingredients to fuse and enhance your team. Discover hundreds of combinations, which can augment your creatures, teach them new skills and even change their appearances.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/974356888e9187c4a83ec7cd3906b41f.poster.avif?t=1747074798\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/974356888e9187c4a83ec7cd3906b41f.webm?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464460/extras/974356888e9187c4a83ec7cd3906b41f.mp4?t=1747074798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based Strategic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic battles with unique passives that trigger based on your team composition. Manage your creatures\u2019 